Package: dsCohortConstructorClient
Title: DataSHIELD Client Functions for 'CohortConstructor'
Version: 0.0.0.0001
Authors@R: person("dsDarwin", "contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "karectl@lthtr.nhs.uk")
Description: Client-side DataSHIELD functions that wrap 'CohortConstructor' from
    DARWIN EU. Each one sends a call to the matching server function in
    'dsCohortConstructor' and returns only what the server lets out.
